From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thibaut Lapierre <root@epheo.eu>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/18] ovn: enable multi-network

OVN secondary networks (layer2 and localnet NetworkAttachmentDefinitions
attached through multus) work out of the box: enable-multi-network=true
goes into the ovnkube-config template itself, so no runtime ConfigMap
edit is needed.

0010 and 0011 build on it: OVN-K enables MultiNetworkPolicy only together
with multi-network.

Upstream: no config knob as of 5.0.
Covered by: vm-test (layer2 NAD attach, MultiNetworkPolicy probe).
---
 assets/components/ovn/common/configmap.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/assets/components/ovn/common/configmap.yaml b/assets/components/ovn/common/configmap.yaml
index 7279ce1fb83283099232f481e243bb976386295c..c6abdd4c4aad1459c34ad73f262bf8e4c4c66af8 100644
--- a/assets/components/ovn/common/configmap.yaml
+++ b/assets/components/ovn/common/configmap.yaml
@@ -25,6 +25,7 @@ data:
     enable-egress-ip=false
     enable-egress-firewall=false
     enable-egress-qos=false
+    enable-multi-network=true
 
     [gateway]
     mode=local

base-commit: 0f0de241c7978084be7656d979cf11860eca08b2
